{"id":"br_wEHgfOcWP21AmIS8GiSO9olW7MvAeNTCEbH9Z25HXd4","model":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731","question_id":"question-000001","question":"Simplify the polynomial equation $x*(9 - 3*x^2 - 12*x) - 6*x*(-2*x^2 + 5 - 10*x)$.","steps":["Distribute $x$ in the first term: $x*(9 - 3x^2 - 12x) = 9x - 3x^3 - 12x^2$.","Distribute $-6x$ in the second term: $-6x*(-2x^2 + 5 - 10x) = 12x^3 - 30x + 60x^2$.","Combine like terms: $(-3x^3 + 12x^3) + (-12x^2 + 60x^2) + (9x - 30x) = 9x^3 + 48x^2 - 21x$."],"final_answer":"9*x^3 + 48*x^2 - 21*x","whether_correct":true}
{"id":"br_fN06HP5GSHIwM9zUavNEQJubamMnXY-tzpl9iL2EIYI","model":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731","question_id":"question-000002","question":"Simplify the polynomial equation $(-5 - 6*x)^2$.","steps":["Write the square as a product: $(-5 - 6x)^2 = (-5 - 6x)(-5 - 6x)$.","Expand using the distributive property: $(-5)(-5) + (-5)(-6x) + (-6x)(-5) + (-6x)(-6x)$.","Simplify each term: $25 + 30x + 30x + 36x^2$.","Combine like terms: $25 + 60x + 36x^2$."],"final_answer":"36*x^2 + 60*x + 25","whether_correct":true}
{"id":"br_g7v4WBgNipavTeMAldfc3-9LKEAPeYcxu8VnN-Sck_4","model":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731","question_id":"question-000003","question":"Simplify the polynomial equation $-(12 + 7*x^2 - 9*x - 17*(2*x^2 + 5*x + 6))$.","steps":["Distribute $-17$ inside the parentheses: $-(12 + 7x^2 - 9x - 34x^2 - 85x - 102)$.","Combine like terms inside: $7x^2 - 34x^2 = -27x^2$, $-9x - 85x = -94x$, $12 - 102 = -90$, so we have $-(-27x^2 - 94x - 90)$.","Distribute the leading negative: $27x^2 + 94x + 90$."],"final_answer":"27*x^2 + 94*x + 90","whether_correct":true}
{"id":"br_t2nxrFkdwARx1Msnc3-vcchJ8eYvBSIc91MagG0JenQ","model":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731","question_id":"question-000004","question":"Simplify the polynomial equation $3*x*(4 - 3*x - 5*x^2) - x^2*(-11 - 67*x)$.","steps":["Distribute $3x$: $3x(4 - 3x - 5x^2) = 12x - 9x^2 - 15x^3$.","Distribute $-x^2$: $-x^2(-11 - 67x) = 11x^2 + 67x^3$.","Add the results: $(12x - 9x^2 - 15x^3) + (11x^2 + 67x^3) = 12x + 2x^2 + 52x^3$."],"final_answer":"12*x + 2*x^2 + 52*x^3","whether_correct":true}
{"id":"br_Yn9ckDRGNZHxp585ZkDmr4P_TrQrBNYnvb7OL8NwAdk","model":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731","question_id":"question-000005","question":"Simplify the polynomial equation $-55 - 5 + 38 - 9*x^2 - 6*x^2$.","steps":["Combine the constant terms: $-55 - 5 + 38 = -22$.","Combine the $x^2$ terms: $-9x^2 - 6x^2 = -15x^2$.","Write the simplified expression: $-15x^2 - 22$."],"final_answer":"-15*x^2 - 22","whether_correct":true}
{"id":"br_WOfEJsP__8eYJHngnH7j0812K8Bp94x3zRV7btz-mOQ","model":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731","question_id":"question-000006","question":"Simplify the polynomial equation $(3 + 2*x)^2$.","steps":["Expand the square: $(3 + 2x)^2 = (3 + 2x)(3 + 2x)$.","Apply the distributive property: $3(3 + 2x) + 2x(3 + 2x) = 9 + 6x + 6x + 4x^2$.","Combine like terms: $9 + (6x + 6x) + 4x^2 = 9 + 12x + 4x^2$."],"final_answer":"4*x^2 + 12*x + 9","whether_correct":true}
{"id":"br_fhMirHJFORn7ssdQ4_srd1Xh8qUn5heJNSAzZYhc0g4","model":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731","question_id":"question-000007","question":"Simplify the polynomial equation $-4*x^2*(-3 - 3*y) - 7*x*y*(10*x + 5)$.","steps":["Distribute $-4x^2$ over $(-3 - 3y)$: $-4x^2(-3) + (-4x^2)(-3y) = 12x^2 + 12x^2y$.","Distribute $-7xy$ over $(10x + 5)$: $-7xy(10x) + (-7xy)(5) = -70x^2y - 35xy$.","Combine like terms: $12x^2 + 12x^2y - 70x^2y - 35xy = 12x^2 - 58x^2y - 35xy$."],"final_answer":"12*x^2 - 58*x^2*y - 35*x*y","whether_correct":true}
{"id":"br_F7_yoqoMyZTrc06VzgkNzvz9INbGMqXkMcPwkxdXmSg","model":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731","question_id":"question-000008","question":"Simplify the polynomial equation $55*x + 3*x^2 + 9*x^3 - 5 - 5*x^3 + 9 - x^2 - 6*x$.","steps":["Group like terms: $(9x^3 - 5x^3) + (3x^2 - x^2) + (55x - 6x) + (-5 + 9)$.","Combine each group: $4x^3 + 2x^2 + 49x + 4$."],"final_answer":"4*x^3 + 2*x^2 + 49*x + 4","whether_correct":true}
{"id":"br_mpkiHTjpICTHcozQS02f9xpdei1bhIESH6jy0s2BP-o","model":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731","question_id":"question-000009","question":"Simplify the polynomial equation $(3*x^2 - 12)*(2*x^2 + 8 + 3*x)$.","steps":["Distribute each term of $(3x^2 - 12)$ over $(2x^2 + 3x + 8)$: $3x^2(2x^2+3x+8) - 12(2x^2+3x+8)$.","Expand: $6x^4 + 9x^3 + 24x^2 - 24x^2 - 36x - 96$.","Combine like terms: $6x^4 + 9x^3 + (24x^2-24x^2) - 36x - 96 = 6x^4 + 9x^3 - 36x - 96$."],"final_answer":"6*x^4 + 9*x^3 - 36*x - 96","whether_correct":true}
{"id":"br_j7p5z4QakuHfprfGC7ZD3PPZ0hh1ED92poNsMcffwlI","model":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731","question_id":"question-000010","question":"Simplify the polynomial equation $79*y + 15*y - 8*x^2*y + 10*x - 35 - 8*x^2*y - 10*x - 30*x*y + 6*x*y + 8*x^2*y - 8$.","steps":["Combine the $y$ terms: $79y + 15y = 94y$.","Combine the $x^2y$ terms: $-8x^2y - 8x^2y + 8x^2y = -8x^2y$.","Combine the $xy$ terms: $-30xy + 6xy = -24xy$.","Combine the $x$ terms: $10x - 10x = 0$.","Combine the constants: $-35 - 8 = -43$. Thus the simplified expression is $94y - 8x^2y - 24xy - 43$."],"final_answer":"94*y - 8*x^2*y - 24*x*y - 43","whether_correct":true}
{"id":"br_umw6FshLQlX6gc7ERcZFCA6H8TQCr2PjK_Vm76RLjQo","model":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731","question_id":"question-000011","question":"Simplify the polynomial equation $-4*(5 - 11*x^2 - 9*(-x^2 + 2))$.","steps":["Distribute the $-9$ inside the inner parentheses: $-9*(-x^2 + 2) = 9x^2 - 18$.","Substitute into the expression: $5 - 11x^2 - (9x^2 - 18) = 5 - 11x^2 - 9x^2 + 18 = 23 - 20x^2$.","Multiply by $-4$: $-4*(23 - 20x^2) = -92 + 80x^2$."],"final_answer":"80*x^2 - 92","whether_correct":false}
{"id":"br_n3LpCLv_PUjuMVqT8bz5y2RZAGNptHNT2uIfgSzIrAE","model":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731","question_id":"question-000012","question":"Simplify the polynomial equation $-8*x*(-10 - 11*x^2) - 7*x*(11*x - 2) - 9*x*(2 + 9*x^2)$.","steps":["Expand each product: $-8x(-10 - 11x^2) = 80x + 88x^3$, $-7x(11x - 2) = -77x^2 + 14x$, and $-9x(2 + 9x^2) = -18x - 81x^3$.","Combine the expanded terms: $(80x + 88x^3) + (-77x^2 + 14x) + (-18x - 81x^3)$.","Group like terms: $x^3$: $88x^3 - 81x^3 = 7x^3$; $x^2$: $-77x^2$; $x$: $80x + 14x - 18x = 76x$.","Write the simplified expression: $7x^3 - 77x^2 + 76x$."],"final_answer":"7*x^3 - 77*x^2 + 76*x","whether_correct":true}
{"id":"br_R7d_BF6JwjOnI2-emtsbWZ9wJeKCs8AnBaSq3W26zUc","model":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731","question_id":"question-000013","question":"Simplify the polynomial equation $3*(10*x + 16*x^2 + 12 - (-x^2 + 10*x + 8))$.","steps":["Distribute the negative sign inside the parentheses: $10x + 16x^2 + 12 - (-x^2 + 10x + 8) = 10x + 16x^2 + 12 + x^2 - 10x - 8$.","Combine like terms: $(16x^2 + x^2) + (10x - 10x) + (12 - 8) = 17x^2 + 4$.","Multiply by 3: $3(17x^2 + 4) = 51x^2 + 12$."],"final_answer":"51*x^2 + 12","whether_correct":true}
{"id":"br_mTC9gSEIdV_4xOXaZ6lMIEFamuL1lkACkYGK8xIyhcg","model":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731","question_id":"question-000014","question":"Simplify the polynomial equation $3*x^2*(-2 + 3*x) + x*(-12 - 8*x^2 + 12*x)$.","steps":["Expand the first term: $3x^2(-2+3x) = -6x^2 + 9x^3$.","Expand the second term: $x(-12 - 8x^2 + 12x) = -12x - 8x^3 + 12x^2$.","Combine like terms: $(9x^3 - 8x^3) + (-6x^2 + 12x^2) - 12x = x^3 + 6x^2 - 12x$."],"final_answer":"x^3 + 6*x^2 - 12*x","whether_correct":true}
{"id":"br_nVtjVfgw4e7ZR-Fz8Cpx7bq3TtjI8GMohBv30IRSLlA","model":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731","question_id":"question-000015","question":"Simplify the polynomial equation $(8*x - 4)^2$.","steps":["Write the square as a product: $(8x - 4)^2 = (8x - 4)(8x - 4)$.","Expand using FOIL: $(8x)(8x) + (8x)(-4) + (-4)(8x) + (-4)(-4) = 64x^2 - 32x - 32x + 16$.","Combine like terms: $64x^2 - 64x + 16$."],"final_answer":"64*x^2 - 64*x + 16","whether_correct":true}
{"id":"br_p8s2b6xmNlqTz67cEvqa-iHICCZZFojs8yU1UhZKV6E","model":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731","question_id":"question-000016","question":"Simplify the polynomial equation $(3*x + 71*x^2 - 8 + (-8*x^2 + 6))$.","steps":["Remove parentheses: $3x + 71x^2 - 8 - 8x^2 + 6$.","Combine like terms: $71x^2 - 8x^2 = 63x^2$, $3x$ stays, and $-8 + 6 = -2$.","Write the simplified expression: $63x^2 + 3x - 2$."],"final_answer":"63*x^2 + 3*x - 2","whether_correct":true}
{"id":"br_pVUisEVebk-uWtIgGKIJZ1qis0iT67qnYxyH90HUSZY","model":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731","question_id":"question-000017","question":"Simplify the polynomial equation $(3*x^2 + 9)*(8 - 11*y)$.","steps":["Distribute each term of the first factor over the second factor: $3x^2(8 - 11y) + 9(8 - 11y)$.","Multiply: $24x^2 - 33x^2y + 72 - 99y$."],"final_answer":"24*x^2 - 33*x^2*y + 72 - 99*y","whether_correct":true}
{"id":"br_tBzBYoy3ow5HkM3wcnt6o82tYWjKbvHb6nWB_fhFSUY","model":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731","question_id":"question-000018","question":"Simplify the polynomial equation $2*x - 2 + 98*x - 1 - 24*x$.","steps":["Group like terms: $(2*x + 98*x - 24*x) + (-2 - 1)$.","Combine the $x$-terms: $2*x + 98*x - 24*x = 76*x$.","Combine the constants: $-2 - 1 = -3$.","The simplified expression is $76*x - 3$, so $\\boxed{76*x - 3}$."],"final_answer":"76*x - 3","whether_correct":true}
{"id":"br_4ShEaxb--_pfhanJqI9e1AEOkUz_jxTGU4EOyQAAQFI","model":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731","question_id":"question-000019","question":"Simplify the polynomial equation $(11*y^2 + 4 - 5*(12*y^2 + 6*x + 9))$.","steps":["Distribute the $-5$ across the parentheses: $11y^2 + 4 - 60y^2 - 30x - 45$.","Combine like terms: $(11y^2 - 60y^2) + (4 - 45) - 30x$.","Simplify: $-49y^2 - 30x - 41$."],"final_answer":"-49*y^2 - 30*x - 41","whether_correct":true}
{"id":"br_GZ12a-RksVgKbzXpUe0SBy4CUah0LKlmnxK3ybu_8os","model":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731","question_id":"question-000020","question":"Simplify the polynomial equation $7*x + 8*x + 2*x^2 - 5 - 3*x^2 + 8$.","steps":["Combine the $x$ terms: $7x + 8x = 15x$.","Combine the $x^2$ terms: $2x^2 - 3x^2 = -x^2$.","Combine the constants: $-5 + 8 = 3$.","Write the simplified expression: $15x - x^2 + 3$, or equivalently $-x^2 + 15x + 3$."],"final_answer":"-x^2 + 15*x + 3","whether_correct":true}
